  "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Date :</strong> 15th to 17th December 2022<br /><strong>Venue : </strong>Seminar Hall, Department of Mechanical Engineering, ATMECE, Mysuru</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>The objectives of the workshop is intended</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->\n<ol style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To enhance the knowledge in the field of Automation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To develop the expertise in interfacing PLC &amp; SCADA knowledge used in Process Automation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>To inherit the proficiency required to adopt to the everchanging technical World.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Outcome</strong><br />Participants will be able to develop interfacing capability between PLC/SCADA and Automation and to discover career opportunities in the field of Automation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
